    "details": "<p><strong>Overview:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Manufacture Your Dream</strong> is a hands-on engineering and racing competition organized by the <strong>Society of Manufacturing Engineers</strong> for <strong>graVITas 2026</strong>. The event combines teamwork, creativity, and friendly competition into an engaging challenge where participants build and race their own vehicles.</p>\n<p><strong>The competition consists of two core phases:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>The Assembly Phase:</strong> Teams receive all required tools and materials to assemble a remote-controlled car as quickly and accurately as possible under expert guidance.</li>\n<li><strong>The Racing Phase:</strong> Assembled vehicles hit a specially designed track to compete in multi-round heat races testing speed and handling through to the semi-finals and final.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Winners are determined by the <strong>lowest combined total time</strong> (Assembly Time + Racing Time). The top overall finishers take home cash prizes from the event pool!</p>\n<p><strong>Guidelines &amp; Details:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Format:</strong> Hands-on Hardware Assembly + Track Racing</li>\n<li><strong>Rounds:</strong> Initial Heats &rarr; Semi-Finals &rarr; Final Race</li>\n<li><strong>Team Structure:</strong> Team-based event</li>\n<li><strong>Single Participation:</strong> If you register without a team, a team will be assigned/arranged for you at the venue.</li>\n<li><strong>Inter-College Teams Allowed:</strong> Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Inter-Specialization Teams Allowed:</strong> Yes</li>\n<li><strong>Duration:</strong> Slot-based execution. Participants will be notified of their allotted time slot prior to the event.</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Rules &amp; Regulations:</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Adherence to Instructions:</strong> Pay strict attention to all preliminary technical instructions; they are critical for assembling a functional car.</li>\n<li><strong>Component Care:</strong> All components, materials, and remote assemblies must be handled with utmost care. Any intentional damage or negligence resulting in broken hardware will lead to <strong>instant disqualification</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Punctuality &amp; Check-In:</strong> Participants must arrive at the venue strictly at their allotted time slot with their official <strong>College ID Cards</strong>.</li>\n<li><strong>Track Safety:</strong> For safety and competition integrity, touching or interfering with the race track during an active heat is strictly prohibited.</li>\n<li><strong>Support &amp; Assistance:</strong> Event managers and guides will be available on-site at all times to address queries and assist with technical issues.</li>\n<li><strong>Fair Play:</strong> Maintain sportsmanship and follow all on-site official instructions. Above all, have fun!</li>\n<li>You can complete the payment after registering on Unstop: <a href=\"http://gravitas.vit.ac.in/events/3317a6e6-3963-43c0-ab99-930e8934539d\">gravitas.vit.ac.in/events/3317a6e6-3963-43c0-ab99-930e8934539d</a></li>\n</ul>",
